statement:
Ось package.json тестового проєкту:

```json
{
  "scripts": {
    "test": "playwright test",
    "test:smoke": "playwright test --grep @smoke",
    "report": "playwright show-report"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@playwright/test": "^1.48.0",
    "typescript": "^5.6.3"
  }
}
```

Що станеться після кожної команди?
